@startuml
!theme plain
title Relay protocol ownership and runtime boundaries

artifact "Protocol v1 schema" as Schema
component "Generated Swift constants" as SwiftGen
component "Generated relay constants" as RelayGen

package "Apple packet tunnel extension" {
  [HEV UDP-in-TCP] as HEV
  [Swift relay protocol client] as Client
  [Capability controller] as Capability
}

node "Authenticated user SSH host" {
  [relux-relay --stdio] as Relay
  [Bounded UDP association sockets] as Sockets
}

Schema --> SwiftGen : deterministic generation
Schema --> RelayGen : deterministic generation
SwiftGen --> Client
RelayGen --> Relay
HEV --> Client : bounded inner datagrams
Client <--> Relay : handshake and framed protocol v1\nover authenticated SSH exec stdio
Relay --> Sockets : rootless UDP send and receive
Client --> Capability : build, features, limits, health, failure
note bottom of Relay
No root
No daemon
No public listener
stdout is framed bytes only
end note
@enduml